#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; is a Breakout-like game."
msgstr "&kappname; je Breakout-like igra."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The object of the game is to destroy as many bricks as possible without "
"losing the ball."
msgstr "Svrha igre je uništiti što više cigli bez gubitka lopte."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player is presented with a game field containing a number of bricks. A "
"ball travels across the screen, bouncing off the top and side walls. When a "
"brick is hit, the ball bounces away and the brick is destroyed. The player "
"loses a life when the ball touches the bottom of the field. To prevent this "
"from happening, the player has to use a movable bar to bounce the ball "
"upward, situated at the bottom of the window. The purpose of the game is to "
"progress through the levels destroying all bricks present in each, and "
"trying to get a highscore."
msgstr ""
"Igraču je predstavljen teren za igranje koji sadrži brojne cigle. Lopta "
"putuje preko ekrana, odbijajući se od gornje i bočne zidove. Kada je udarila "
"ciglu, lopta se odbija dalje i cigla je uništena. Igrač gubi život kada "
"lopta dodirne dno polja. Da bi to spriječili, igrač mora da koristi pokretnu "
"traku da odbije loptu prema gore, koja se nalazi na dnu prozora. Svrha igre "
"je napredovanje kroz novioe uništavajući sve cigle prisutane u svakom"
"(prozoru), i pokušavanje postizanja najboljeg rezultata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some bricks have a special behavior, or may let a gift fall down when hit. "
"The gifts can be caught with the bar, their behavior can be either positive "
"or negative. For further information on the different types of bricks and "
"gifts see the next chapter."
msgstr ""
"Neke cigle imaju posebano ponašanje, ili mogu pustiti poklon da pada kada su "
"udarene. Pokloni mogu biti uhvaćeni sa barom, njihovo ponašanje može biti "
"pozitivano ili negativano. Za više informacija o različitim vrstama cigli i "
"poklona pogledajte sljedeće poglavlje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To fire the ball press the spacebar, to move the bar use the mouse or the "
"arrow keys. The ball will bounce in the direction of the side of the bar it "
"bounced on hit, the more it bounces near the left end of the bar the more it "
"will bounce toward the left, the same applies for the right side; if it "
"bounces in the middle of the bar it will bounce straight toward the top."
msgstr ""
"Za vatrenu loptu pritisnite razmak, za pomjeranje bar-a koristite miš ili "
"tipke sa strelicama. Lopta će odskočiti u pravcu sa strane gdje se odbila od "
"bara, što se više odbija blizu lijevog kraja bara više će odskočiti prema "
"lijevoj strani, isto se odnosi i na desnu stranu; ako se odbija u sredini "
"bara, odskočiti će ravno prema vrhu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila Igre, Strategija i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Passing a level awards 300 points to the player. A level is passed when all "
"breakable and visible bricks are destroyed, or alternatively if the next "
"level gift is caught. In the latter case an additional score for each "
"remaining brick is awarded."
msgstr ""
"Prelazeći nivo igrač dobije 300 nagradnih poena.  Nivo je pređen kada su "
"uništene sve lomljive i vidljive cigle, ili alternativno, ako je uhvaćen "
"poklon za sljedeći nivo. U ovom drugom slučaju dodan je nagradni rezultat za "
"svaku preostalu ciglu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A score is awarded for every brick destroyed, the smaller the interval "
"between one hit and the following the higher this score."
msgstr ""
"Rezultat se povećava za svaku ciglu koja je uništena, manji interval između "
"jednog udarca i narednog povećava rezultat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This gifts hidden in a given level are fixed, their position however is "
"random."
msgstr ""
"Ovi pokloni skriveni u određenom nivou su fiksirani, njihov položaj, "
"međutim, je slučajan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "30 points are awarded for every gift caught."
msgstr "30 nagradnih poena za svaki uhvaćeni poklon."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player loses a life when the ball touches the bottom of the field and "
"there are no other balls left in the game, or when he catches a lose life "
"gift. When losing a life 1000 points are detracted from his score."
msgstr ""
"Igrač izgubi život kada lopta udari od dno polja, i nemaju drugih lopti u "
"igri, ili kada uhvati poklon koji oduzima život. Pri gubljenju života "
"rezultat se umanjuje za 1000 poena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional lives can be gained by catching the add life gift."
msgstr "Dodatni životi se mogu postići sa hvatanjem poklona koji daje život."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game ends when the player loses the ball while not having any additional "
"lives left, or when all levels have been won."
msgstr ""
"Igra završava kada igrač izgubi loptu, a nije mu ostalo nikakvih dodatnih "
"života, ili kada osvoji sve nivoe."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brick Types"
msgstr "Tip Cigle"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pictures for the bricks below are for the default theme of &kbreakout;."
msgstr "Slike za cigle u nastavku su za obične temu &kbreakout;."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plain Brick"
msgstr "Obična cigla"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plain Bricks"
msgstr "Obične cigle"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simple bricks, while their appearance may vary they all behave the same way, "
"they get destroyed when hit by the ball and may contain a gift."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavne cigle, dok se njihov nastup može razlikovati, sve se ponašaju na "
"isti način, uništene su kada ih udari lopta, i mogu sadržavati poklon."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Unbreakable Brick</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Nelomljiva Cigla</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Unbreakable Brick</term>"
msgstr "<term>Nelomljiva cigla</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Never gets destroyed unless hit by a burning or unstoppable ball, or an "
"exploding brick next to it gets hit. These bricks do not need to be "
"destroyed to win the level."
msgstr ""
"Nikada ne biva uništena, osim ako je udarila zapaljena ili nezaustavljiva "
"lopta, ili ako je udarena eksplodirajuća cigla pored nje. Ove cigle ne "
"trebaju biti uništene da se osvoji nivo."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Breakable Brick</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Lomljiva cigla</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Breakable Brick</term>"
msgstr "<term>Lomljiva cigla</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unbreakable bricks can be turned into breakable bricks using <link linkend="
"\"gift-magic-wand\">Magic Wand gift</link>."
msgstr ""
"Nelomljiva cigla se može pretvoriti u lomljivu ciglu koristeći  <link "
"linkend=\"gift-magic-wand\">Poklon Čarobni Štapić</link>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Hidden Brick</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Skrivena cigla</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Hidden Brick</term>"
msgstr "<term>Skrivena cigla</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This brick is not initially shown to the player. When hit for the fist time "
"it becomes visible, and becomes a plain brick. If hit by a burning ball, or "
"an exploding brick next to it gets hit it gets destroyed as soon as it "
"appears. As long as it remains hidden it does not need to be destroyed to "
"get to the next level."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj cigla na početku nije prikazan igraču. Kada je udari prvi put onda "
"postane vidljiva, i postaje obična cigla. Ako je udarena sa vatrenom loptom, "
"ili lopta udari eksplodirajuću ciglu pored nje, onda je uništena čim se "
"pojavi. Dokle dok god ona ostaje skrivena ne treba da bude uništena da se "
"pređe na sljedeći nivo."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Multiple Brick</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Povećavajuća cigla</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Multiple Brick</term>"
msgstr "<term>Povećavajuća cigla</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Needs to be hit three times before getting destroyed, unless hit by a "
"burning or unstoppable ball, or an exploding brick next to it gets destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Treba da se udari tri puta prije nego bude uništena, osim ako je udarila "
"vatrena ili nezaustavljiva lopta, ili ako eksplodirajuća cigla pored nje "
"bude uništena."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Exploding Brick</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Eksplodirajuća Cigla</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Exploding Brick</term>"
msgstr "<term>Eksplodirajuća Cigla</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this brick gets hit also the bricks to the top, bottom, left and right "
"of it will get destroyed, regardless of their type."
msgstr ""
"Kada ovu ciglu udari lopta, također će biti uništene ona iznad, ispod, "
"lijevo i desno od nje, bez obzira na njihov tip."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gifts"
msgstr "Pokloni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pictures for the gifts below are for the default theme of &kbreakout;."
msgstr "Slike za poklone ispod su za običnu temu &kbreakout;."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gift 1000 Points"
msgstr "Poklon 1000 Poena"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Score Gifts"
msgstr "Pokloni Rezultata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If caught they award the player the number of points written on the gift."
msgstr ""
"Ako su uhvaćeni, nagrade igrača sa brojem poena koji je napisan na poklonu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Add Life Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dodaj Život Poklon</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Add Life Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Dodaj Život Poklon</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gives the player an additional life."
msgstr "Daje igraču dodatni život."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Lose Life Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Gubljenje Života</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Lose Life Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Gubljenje Života</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes the player lose all balls and resets the bar."
msgstr "Igrač gubi sve lopte i resetuje reket."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Enlarge Bar Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Uvećavanja reketa</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Enlarge Bar Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Uvećavanja reketa</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enlarges the bar."
msgstr "Povećava reket."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Shrink Bar Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Smanjivanja reketa</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Shrink Bar Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Smanjivanja reketa</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shrinks the bar."
msgstr "Smanjuje reket."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Split Balls Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Razdvajanja Lopte</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Split Balls Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Razdvajanja Lopte</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "Doubles the balls."
msgstr "Uduplava broj lopti."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Add Balls Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Dodavanja Lopti</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Add Balls Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Dodavanja Lopti</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gives the player an extra ball attached to the bar, which can be fired "
"whenever the player wants."
msgstr ""
"Daje igraču dodatnu loptu privrženu za bar, koja se može ispaliti kad god "
"igrač želi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Sticky Bar Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon ljepljivi reket</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Sticky Bar Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon ljepljivi reket</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After catching this gift, every time a ball touches the bar it remains "
"attached to it, allowing the player to fire again."
msgstr ""
"Nakon hvatanja ovog poklona, svaki put kad lopta dirne reket, ostane "
"privčršćena za njega, dopuštajući igraču da je opet ispali."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>More Exploding Bricks Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Više Eksplodirajućih Cigli</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>More Exploding Bricks Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Više Eksplodirajućih Cigli</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Makes all bricks to the top, bottom, right, and left of exploding bricks "
"exploding bricks themselves. This also applies to hidden and unbreakable "
"bricks."
msgstr ""
"Čini sve cigle na vrhu, dnu, desno i lijevo od eksplodirajuće cigle također "
"eksplodirajućim ciglama. To se odnosi i na skrivene i nelomljive cigle."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Burning Ball Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Zapaljene Lopte</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Burning Ball Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Vatrene Lopte</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Transforms all the balls in burning balls. When a burning ball hits a brick "
"also the bricks to the top, bottom, left and right of it get destroyed. A "
"burning ball destroys all types of bricks regardless of their types."
msgstr ""
"Pretvara sve lopte u vatrene lopte. Kada vatrena lopta udari u ciglu, i "
"cigle iznad, ispod, lijevo i desno od nje budu uništene. Vatrena lopta "
"uništava sve tipove cigli bez obzira na njihov tip."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Unstoppable Ball Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Nezaustavljiva Lopta</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Unstoppable Ball Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Nezaustavljiva Lopta</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Transforms all the balls into unstoppable balls. An unstoppable ball "
"destroys all bricks it encounters on it's path, regardless of their type, "
"and never bouncing against them."
msgstr ""
"Pretvara sve lopte u nezaustavljive. Nezaustavljiva lopta uništava sve cigle "
"koje joj se nađu na putu, bez obzira na njihov tip, i nikada se ne odbija od "
"njih."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:469
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Magic Eye Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Čarobno Oko</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:473
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Magic Eye Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Čarobno Oko</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows all hidden bricks."
msgstr "Prikazuje sve skrivene cigle."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Magic Wand Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Čarobni Štapić</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:493
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term id=\"gift-magic-wand\">Magic Wand Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term id=\"gift-magic-wand\">Poklon Čarobni Štapić</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transforms all multiple and unbreakable bricks into simple bricks."
msgstr "Pretvara sve povećavajuće i nelomljive  u obične cigle."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Increase Speed Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Ubrzanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Increase Speed Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Ubrzanje</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:517
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increases the speed of the ball by 30% of the current speed."
msgstr "Ubrzava loptu za 30% njene trenutne brzine."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Decrease Speed Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Usporavanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:533
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Decrease Speed Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Usporavanje</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid "Decreases the speed of the ball dividing the current speed by 1.3."
msgstr "Smanjuje brzinu lopte tako što dijeli trenutnu brzinu sa 1.3."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Next Level Gift</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Poklon Naredni Nivo</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Next Level Gift</term>"
msgstr "<term>Poklon Naredni Nivo</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the next level of the game immediately."
msgstr "Odmah otvara naredni nivo igre."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i Savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If possible, it is usually a good idea to send the ball above the bricks, "
"doing so you will have a smaller chance of losing the ball. Sometimes you "
"need to first make a small hole in the layer of brick to accomplish this. "
"The smaller the hole, the smaller the chance the balls comes back down."
msgstr ""
"Ako je moguće, obično je dobra ideja da se pošalje lopta iznad cigle, radeći "
"tako možete imati manje šanse da izgubite loptu. Ponekad vam je potrebno "
"prvo napraviti malu rupu u sloju od cigli da se ostvari ovo. Što je manja "
"rupa, to je manja šansa da vrati dole."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When catching the add ball gift it is wise to not fire it right away but to "
"keep in instead, in case the other balls are lost. It is also advisable to "
"not catch a sticky bar gift in such a case, as doing so would force you to "
"fire all balls."
msgstr ""
"Kada uhvatite poklon koji vam daje još jednu loptu mudro je ne ispaliti je "
"odmah, nego čuvati je umjesto toga, u slučaju da ste izgubili druge lopte. "
"Također se preporučuje da se ne uhvati ljepljivi bar poklon jer u tom "
"slučaju, morali bi ispaliti sve lopte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:570
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When receiving a next level gift you may not want to catch it if you know "
"that there are add life gifts in the level."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom puštanja poklona za sljedeći nivo, moguće je da ga ne želite "
"uhvatiti ako znate da postoje pokloni za dodatni život na tom nivou."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In levels where there are a lot of hidden bricks there may be a way to win "
"the level without having to destroy most of them."
msgstr ""
"U nivoima gdje ima dosta skrivenih cigli, moguće je da postoji način da se "
"pređe nivo bez uništavanja većine njih."

